WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.325
Kɔshɔ na SaloneHCM employee self-service training.

2
00:00:03.325 --> 00:00:14.578
A short session yɛ ɛ lap yu ɛ sɔntin wɛ yu mɛmɛf bɔd du — yu luk yu payslips, yu bɛg leave, yu rait yu attendance, ɛn yu chɛk yu details — wantɛm yu nɔ de wet long lain na H R office.

3
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.440
Sign in wit di work email ɛn password wɛ H R gi yu.

4
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:22.568
If yu fɔgɛt yu password, yu administrator bɔd reset am in seconds.

5
00:00:22.568 --> 00:00:25.258
Mɛk a sign in as Joseph, wan civil servant.

6
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.229
Di self-service page na yu home.

7
00:00:28.229 --> 00:00:32.683
Yu payslips dɛn list wit gross pay, deductions, ɛn net pay fɔ ɛvri mɔnt.

8
00:00:32.683 --> 00:00:42.642
Open ɛni wan fɔ si di ful breakdown — yu P A Y E tax, yu NASSIT contribution, ɛni loan repayment — ɛn download di P D F fɔ yu records ɔ fɔ bank loan application.

9
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:49.555
Yu nid taym ɔf? Go na leave, prɛs new request, chuz yu dates ɛn leave type, ɛn submit.

10
00:00:49.555 --> 00:00:55.662
Yu manager gɛt notify wantɛm taym, ɛn yu bɔd wach di status chenj frɔm pending to approved rayt ya.

11
00:00:55.662 --> 00:00:59.178
Yu remaining balance ɔltɛm de sho, so gɛsin gem nɔ de de.

12
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:04.363
Na di attendance page yu clock in ɛn out, ɛn review yu yon history.

13
00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:11.914
If sɔntin luk rɔng — wan missed clock-out, fɔ ɛgzampul — tɛl yu H R officer ɛn dɛn bɔd kɔrɛkt am, wit di correction logged.

14
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:17.034
Na dat — payslips, leave, ɛn attendance, ɔl na yu yon hand dɛn.

15
00:01:17.034 --> 00:01:24.002
If yu nɔ shɔ bɔt ɛnitin, di Training Center gɛt wan quick reference card wɛ dɛn mek jɔs fɔ employees. Tɛnki fɔ wach.
